  "body": "Immaculate Impeccably Renovated Home | Milford on the Flat\r\n\r\nSet on a private site in highly desirable Fenwick Avenue, this impeccably renovated home by Salt Projects (with CCC now issued from Council), really has to be seen in person to be truely appreciated. Commanding all day sun, superb indoor outdoor flow, spacious size, private aspect and exceptional craftsmanship, every detail has been meticulously crafted with sophisticated design which allows for effortless living. \r\n\r\nTimeless materials including weatherboard and cedar cladding combine to create a striking architectural statement. The expansive open-plan kitchen, living and dining living areas flows seamlessly out to multiple sun-drenched entertaining areas, offering effortless indoor-outdoor living-perfect for year-round entertaining.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a gourmet entertainer's kitchen impresses with substantial bench space, plenty of storage and premium appliances.\r\n\r\nThe home features three oversized bedrooms, including a luxurious master retreat complete with a custom walk-thru wardrobe and stylish ensuite. There is a gorgeous family bathroom to service the other two bedrooms plus a guest powder room on the ground floor.\r\n\r\nSerene garden landscaping create a private sanctuary ideal for relaxation or entertaining. Additional highlights include a study, double-glazed joinery, ducted air-conditioning system, underfloor heating in the bathrooms, and a comprehensive suite of premium fixtures and fittings. A garage with internal access garage, separate laundry, storage cupboards, ample off-street parking plus a large pebble parking area beside the home allowing room for additional cars, boat or caravan.\r\n\r\nHomes of this calibre, in this location are rare and extremely hard to find - don't miss this incredible opportunity to secure this superb residence.",
